WEBVTT

00:24.925 --> 00:31.491
The stage is empty The crowd is gone Another

00:31.551 --> 00:33.572
night, another dawn

00:36.855 --> 00:44.221
We played the part We sang the song And now we have

00:44.281 --> 00:49.346
to move along The

00:49.386 --> 00:51.728
neon heart is turning low

00:55.225 --> 00:57.886
It's just a faded distant glow

01:01.308 --> 01:05.811
Is this the dream we wanted so? I guess we'll

01:05.871 --> 01:15.476
never know We're just echoes in the city It's not

01:15.576 --> 01:24.521
so bad, it's not so pretty Just echoes turning to

01:24.581 --> 01:31.618
grey We'll come back and find another day A

01:48.807 --> 01:51.148
very soft malachite thirsty

01:56.255 --> 01:57.416
Another day

02:02.300 --> 02:03.280
Another way

02:14.449 --> 02:20.834
Just echoes turn into grey We'll come back and

02:20.894 --> 02:23.476
fight Another day

02:32.550 --> 02:36.351
after the show good night

